  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving food security conditions to peasant associations in the Northeast, Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Corporacin Buen Ambiente (Corambiente), $167,100 over 18 months Corambiente will help mitigate the effects of climate change facing farmers in nine associations in the departments of Santander and Norte de Santander face. It will work to involve more young people in the associations and make members more aware their rights and responsibilities. The project will reach 420 Colombians directly and 340 indirectly. (CO-523-A1)</narrative>
  </description>
